  "description": "Notepad app for PSVITA.",
  "long_description": "Notepad Vita is a simple note-taking app for the PS Vita.\nNotepad Vita uses both the touch screen and the buttons to navigate the menus with a clean and modern look.\nOn the left side you can see a list with all your notes and on the right side the preview of the selected note.\nIt supports multi-line keyboard for easy note editing.\nYour notes are saved in ux0:/data/Notes/ in .txt format.\n\nNote: this download is hosted on an external server, not GitHub, and may stop working if that server goes down or changes without the catalog knowing.",
